    "title": "eBay online shopping & selling",
    "description": "Find just what you need for the holidays on the eBay app. Buy, sell, and browse deals on millions of unique items on the go.\r\n\r\nGET NOTIFIED\r\nStay in the know and save with real-time alerts for Black Friday deals, Cyber Monday offers, and Christmas savings. Keep track of your orders with regular updates sent to your device with personalized notifications.\r\n\r\nSEARCH, FIND, AND SAVE FAVES\r\nSeamless shopping wherever you are:\r\n\u25cf Holiday gifts for everyone on your list: Looking for finds that will blow their mind? Shop something for everyone here.\r\n\u25cf Heart your faves: From top searches to most-loved sellers, never miss the latest drops and deals. Just tap on the heart icon.\r\n\u25cf Image searching: See something you like in person? Simply take a pic, upload it with the push of a button, and find matches straight away.\r\n\u25cf Shop by condition: From brand new to pre-loved fashion and eBay\r\nRefurbished tech, you\u2019ll find something to suit you.\r\n\r\nEBAY AUTHENTICITY GUARANTEE\r\nShop with added confidence. The eBay Authenticity Guarantee badge guarantees that qualified items will be professionally inspected and verified by our team of authenticators.\r\nEBAY MONEY BACK GUARANTEE\r\nWith us, you\u2019re covered. Get the item you ordered or your money back\u2014it\u2019s that simple. Enjoy total peace of mind, thanks to the eBay Money Back Guarantee.\r\nFor full eligibility criteria and all terms & conditions visit: https://pages.ebay.com/ebay-money-back-guarantee/\r\nPAY YOUR WAY\r\nChoose how you pay for your gifts this holiday season. Check out securely with Google Pay, Visa, Mastercard, Paypal, Venmo, and more in an instant.\r\nSELLING MADE SIMPLE\r\nSell past favorites to boost your holiday budget. Your shop\u2019s always at your fingertips\u2014list items using the barcode scanner, upload photos and videos, add tracking, keep up with orders, and chat with your customers live.\r\nKEEP IN TOUCH\r\nYour feedback is important to us. Please contact us with any questions by tweeting @AskeBay or joining the discussion at www.ebay.com/android",
    "descriptionHTML": "Find just what you need for the holidays on the eBay app. Buy, sell, and browse deals on millions of unique items on the go.<br><br>GET NOTIFIED<br>Stay in the know and save with real-time alerts for Black Friday deals, Cyber Monday offers, and Christmas savings. Keep track of your orders with regular updates sent to your device with personalized notifications.<br><br>SEARCH, FIND, AND SAVE FAVES<br>Seamless shopping wherever you are:<br>\u25cf Holiday gifts for everyone on your list: Looking for finds that will blow their mind? Shop something for everyone here.<br>\u25cf Heart your faves: From top searches to most-loved sellers, never miss the latest drops and deals. Just tap on the heart icon.<br>\u25cf Image searching: See something you like in person? Simply take a pic, upload it with the push of a button, and find matches straight away.<br>\u25cf Shop by condition: From brand new to pre-loved fashion and eBay<br>Refurbished tech, you\u2019ll find something to suit you.<br><br>EBAY AUTHENTICITY GUARANTEE<br>Shop with added confidence. The eBay Authenticity Guarantee badge guarantees that qualified items will be professionally inspected and verified by our team of authenticators.<br>EBAY MONEY BACK GUARANTEE<br>With us, you\u2019re covered. Get the item you ordered or your money back\u2014it\u2019s that simple. Enjoy total peace of mind, thanks to the eBay Money Back Guarantee.<br>For full eligibility criteria and all terms &amp; conditions visit: https://pages.ebay.com/ebay-money-back-guarantee/<br>PAY YOUR WAY<br>Choose how you pay for your gifts this holiday season. Check out securely with Google Pay, Visa, Mastercard, Paypal, Venmo, and more in an instant.<br>SELLING MADE SIMPLE<br>Sell past favorites to boost your holiday budget. Your shop\u2019s always at your fingertips\u2014list items using the barcode scanner, upload photos and videos, add tracking, keep up with orders, and chat with your customers live.<br>KEEP IN TOUCH<br>Your feedback is important to us. Please contact us with any questions by tweeting @AskeBay or joining the discussion at www.ebay.com/android",
